 21	// ListHydrationTimeout is the per-ref budget for hydrating names-only List stubs
 22	// during user-facing enumeration (after the display-limit truncate). Shorter than
 23	// the default on-demand fetch budget so a stuck remote cannot turn list/explain
 24	// into many minutes of sequential ref fetches.
